{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-dreaming/1224062-walking-away-from-arcadia-interview","id":1224062,"title":"Walking Away From Arcadia Interview","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Changeling: The Dreaming"],"posts":[{"date":"2018-06-01T20:29:41-07:00","id":1224062,"title":"Walking Away From Arcadia Interview","content":"The folks at Walking Away From Arcadia recently interviewed Luka and me. We talked about Book of Freeholds and very briefly about what\u2019s to come in the C20 Players Guide.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"https://www.podbean.com/media/share/pb-5b2n8-924562\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://d2bwo9zemjwxh5.cloudfront.net/ep-logo/pbblog1726947/Forest_Logo_1400_CC0_1200x628.jpg?s=e7da7f8e31676530dc6ad3db62d7bb0a&amp;e=jpg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://www.podbean.com/media/share/pb-5b2n8-924562\" target=\"_blank\"> Book of Freeholds Interview </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://www.podbean.com/media/share/pb-5b2n8-924562\" target=\"_blank\"> https://www.podbean.com/media/share/pb-5b2n8-924562 </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> Join Victor, Simon, the legendary Luka Carroll, and the captivating Charlie Cantrell for a discussion of the now available Book of Freeholds and the place they see freeholds fitting into a changeling game. We cover some of the new content they created for Changeling 20th, as well as some of what's coming down the pike for the upcoming players' guide. Readings &ldquo;Mirror Lights&rdquo; from &ldquo;Book of Freeholds&rdquo; by Onyx Path Publishing &ldquo;Letter&rdquo; from &ldquo;Stardew Valley&rdquo; by Eric \"ConcernedApe\" Barone &ldquo;The Marvelous Land of Oz&rdquo; by Frank L Baum &ldquo;Thief of Always&rdquo; by Clive Barker &ldquo;The Mists of Avalon&rdquo; by Marion Zimmer Bradley Music &ldquo;Wabi Sabi Nightclub&rdquo; by Hypnodrones &ldquo;Spooky Disco&rdquo; by Lobo Loco &ldquo;Hope&rdquo; by Borrtex &ldquo;Throwing a Tantrum&rdquo; by Ask Again \"Camille Saint-Sa&euml;ns: Danse Macabre - Isolated Harp\" by Kevin MacLeod Sound effects Paintbrush, Fireplace, High Street of Gandia (Valencia, Spain), Fountain 1, Birdlife at M&aring;lsjon in Kristdala Sweden, Bell Tolls. You can purchase a copy of Book of Freeholds here.&nbsp; To purchase Changeling: the Dreaming as well as a wide array of other role playing texts go to&nbsp;DriveThruRPG.com. We have a blog now! Come read some of our more fully developed thoughts about playing and playing with the Changeling: the Dreaming rules and setting at&nbsp;Parting the Mists. Portions of the materials are the copyrights and trademarks of White Wolf Publishing AB, and are used with permission. All rights reserved. For more information please visit&nbsp;white-wolf.com. </div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Charlie Cantrell</b><br /> Onyx Path Freelancer <hr />Changeling: The Dreaming 20th Anniversary Edition, Conquering Heroes, Book of Freeholds, Guide to the Night, C20 Players Guide","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/648-pookaknight","name":"PookaKnight","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar648_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"690"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-06-01T21:21:29-07:00","id":1224075,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>PookaKnight</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-dreaming/1224062-walking-away-from-arcadia-interview#post1224062\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">The folks at Walking Away From Arcadia recently interviewed Luka and me. We talked about Book of Freeholds and very briefly about what\u2019s to come in the C20 Players Guide.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://www.podbean.com/media/share/pb-5b2n8-924562\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.podbean.com/media/share/pb-5b2n8-924562</a></div> </div> </div> </div>Gnarly! I've been binging on this Podcast over the last month and almost caught up! I am surprised there are multiple Whitewolfy Podcasts out now, I remember back when there would only be 0-1 at any given time and this one is pretty quality!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/754-eldagusto","name":"Eldagusto","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar754_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-06-01T22:37:50-07:00","id":1224082,"title":"","content":"That answers SO much about freeholds.. in a more Xp happy game you could just keep buying up glamour you invest.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2715-lian","name":"Lian","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5218"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-06-01T23:05:25-07:00","i